From bb6c456f5539c83a2ad651a68ee88ab779ff206d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Ledvich <ilya@compulab.co.il>
Date: Wed, 7 Jan 2026 14:02:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] overlays: add support for iotg-rpi5 device tree overlays
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Upstream-Status: Pending

Add basic support for iotg-rpi5 peripherals and interfaces via device tree
overlays, including:
 - Gateway Management Circuitry (GMC) — EEPROM, TPM, GPIO expander, user LEDs
 - Industrial I/O interfaces:
   - Block A: RS485 and CAN
   - Block B: RS485 and CAN
 - Board-to-board connector

Signed-off-by: Ilya Ledvich <ilya@compulab.co.il>
---
